{"s":65,"v":[{"t":"O Prophet, when you [Muslims] divorce women, divorce them for [the commencement of] their waiting period and keep count of the waiting period, and fear Allāh, your Lord. Do not turn them out of their [husbands'] houses, nor should they [themselves] leave [during that period] unless they are committing a clear immorality. And those are the limits [set by] Allāh. And whoever transgresses the limits of Allāh has certainly wronged himself. You know not; perhaps Allāh will bring about after that a [different] matter.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلنَّبِىُّ","Prophet","l-nabiyu","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّبِىُّ",169]]],["إِذَا","When","idhā",""],["طَلَّقْتُمُ","you divorce","ṭallaqtumu","",[["طَلَّقْ",836],["تُمُ",4]]],["ٱلنِّسَآءَ","[the] women","l-nisāa","",[["ٱل",2],["نِّسَآءَ",210]]],["فَطَلِّقُوهُنَّ","then divorce them","faṭalliqūhunna","",[["فَ",7],["طَلِّقُ",836],["و",4],["هُنَّ",52]]],["لِعِدَّتِهِنَّ","for their waiting period","liʿiddatihinna","",[["لِ",8],["عِدَّتِ",778],["هِنَّ",52]]],["وَأَحْصُوا۟","and keep count","wa-aḥṣū","",[["وَ",1],["أَحْصُ",806],["وا۟",4]]],["ٱلْعِدَّةَ","(of) the waiting period","l-ʿidata","ۖ",[["ٱلْ",2],["عِدَّةَ",778]]],["وَٱتَّقُوا۟","and fear","wa-ittaqū","",[["وَ",1],["ٱتَّقُ",83],["وا۟",4]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["رَبَّكُمْ","your Lord","rabbakum","ۖ",[["رَبَّ",24],["كُمْ",4]]],["لَا","(Do) not","lā",""],["تُخْرِجُوهُنَّ","expel them","tukh'rijūhunna","",[["تُخْرِجُ",131],["و",4],["هُنَّ",52]]],["مِنۢ","from","min",""],["بُيُوتِهِنَّ","their houses","buyūtihinna","",[["بُيُوتِ",191],["هِنَّ",52]]],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["يَخْرُجْنَ","they should leave","yakhruj'na","",[["يَخْرُجْ",232],["نَ",52]]],["إِلَّآ","except","illā",""],["أَن","that","an",""],["يَأْتِينَ","they commit","yatīna","",[["يَأْتِي",62],["نَ",52]]],["بِفَـٰحِشَةٍۢ","an immorality","bifāḥishatin","",[["بِ",10],["فَـٰحِشَةٍۢ",574]]],["مُّبَيِّنَةٍۢ","clear","mubayyinatin","ۚ"],["وَتِلْكَ","And these","watil'ka","",[["وَ",1],["تِ",279],["لْ",0],["كَ",0]]],["حُدُودُ","(are the) limits","ḥudūdu",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi","ۚ"],["وَمَن","And whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["يَتَعَدَّ","transgresses","yataʿadda",""],["حُدُودَ","(the) limits","ḥudūda",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["فَقَدْ","then certainly","faqad","",[["فَ",7],["قَدْ",37]]],["ظَلَمَ","he has wronged","ẓalama",""],["نَفْسَهُۥ","himself","nafsahu","ۚ",[["نَفْسَ",51],["هُۥ",5]]],["لَا","Not","lā",""],["تَدْرِى","you know","tadrī",""],["لَعَلَّ","Perhaps","laʿalla",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["يُحْدِثُ","will bring about","yuḥ'dithu",""],["بَعْدَ","after","baʿda",""],["ذَٰلِكَ","that","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["أَمْرًۭا","a matter","amran",""]]},{"t":"And when they have [nearly] fulfilled their term, either retain them according to acceptable terms or part with them according to acceptable terms. And bring to witness two just men from among you and establish the testimony for [the acceptance of] Allāh. That is instructed to whoever should believe in Allāh and the Last Day. And whoever fears Allāh - He will make for him a way out","w":[["فَإِذَا","Then when","fa-idhā","",[["فَ",7],["إِذَا",36]]],["بَلَغْنَ","they have reached","balaghna","",[["بَلَغْ",302],["نَ",52]]],["أَجَلَهُنَّ","their term","ajalahunna","",[["أَجَلَ",234],["هُنَّ",52]]],["فَأَمْسِكُوهُنَّ","then retain them","fa-amsikūhunna","",[["فَ",7],["أَمْسِكُ",534],["و",4],["هُنَّ",52]]],["بِمَعْرُوفٍ","with kindness","bimaʿrūfin","",[["بِ",10],["مَعْرُوفٍ",321]]],["أَوْ","or","aw",""],["فَارِقُوهُنَّ","part with them","fāriqūhunna","",[["فَارِقُ",3946],["و",4],["هُنَّ",52]]],["بِمَعْرُوفٍۢ","with kindness","bimaʿrūfin","",[["بِ",10],["مَعْرُوفٍۢ",321]]],["وَأَشْهِدُوا۟","And take witness","wa-ashhidū","",[["وَ",1],["أَشْهِدُ",1023],["وا۟",4]]],["ذَوَىْ","two men","dhaway",""],["عَدْلٍۢ","just","ʿadlin",""],["مِّنكُمْ","among you","minkum","",[["مِّن",6],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَأَقِيمُوا۟","and establish","wa-aqīmū","",[["وَ",1],["أَقِيمُ",228],["وا۟",4]]],["ٱلشَّهَـٰدَةَ","the testimony","l-shahādata","",[["ٱل",2],["شَّهَـٰدَةَ",423]]],["لِلَّهِ","for Allah","lillahi","ۚ",[["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["ذَٰلِكُمْ","That","dhālikum","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كُمْ",0]]],["يُوعَظُ","is instructed","yūʿaẓu",""],["بِهِۦ","with it","bihi","",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["مَن","whoever","man",""],["كَانَ","[is]","kāna",""],["يُؤْمِنُ","believes","yu'minu",""],["بِٱللَّهِ","in Allah","bil-lahi","",[["بِ",10],["ٱللَّهِ",9]]],["وَٱلْيَوْمِ","and the Day","wal-yawmi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["يَوْمِ",33]]],["ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","the Last","l-ākhiri","ۚ",[["ٱلْ",2],["ـَٔاخِرِ",89]]],["وَمَن","And whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["يَتَّقِ","fears","yattaqi",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["يَجْعَل","He will make","yajʿal",""],["لَّهُۥ","for him","lahu","",[["لَّ",8],["هُۥ",5]]],["مَخْرَجًۭا","a way out","makhrajan",""]]},{"t":"And will provide for him from where he does not expect. And whoever relies upon Allāh - then He is sufficient for him. Indeed, Allāh will accomplish His purpose. Allāh has already set for everything a [decreed] extent.","w":[["وَيَرْزُقْهُ","And He will provide for him","wayarzuq'hu","",[["وَ",1],["يَرْزُقْ",204],["هُ",5]]],["مِنْ","from","min",""],["حَيْثُ","where","ḥaythu",""],["لَا","not","lā",""],["يَحْتَسِبُ","he thinks","yaḥtasibu","ۚ"],["وَمَن","And whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["يَتَوَكَّلْ","puts his trust","yatawakkal",""],["عَلَى","upon","ʿalā",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["فَهُوَ","then He","fahuwa","",[["فَ",7],["هُوَ",5]]],["حَسْبُهُۥٓ","(is) sufficient for him","ḥasbuhu","ۚ",[["حَسْبُ",762],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["بَـٰلِغُ","(will) accomplish","bālighu",""],["أَمْرِهِۦ","His purpose","amrihi","ۚ",[["أَمْرِ",82],["هِۦ",5]]],["قَدْ","Indeed","qad",""],["جَعَلَ","has set","jaʿala",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu",""],["لِكُلِّ","for every","likulli","",[["لِ",8],["كُلِّ",43]]],["شَىْءٍۢ","thing","shayin",""],["قَدْرًۭا","a measure","qadran",""]]},{"t":"And those who no longer expect menstruation among your women - if you doubt, then their period is three months, and [also for] those who have not menstruated. And for those who are pregnant, their term is until they give birth. And whoever fears Allāh - He will make for him of his matter ease.","w":[["وَٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى","And those who","wa-allāī","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى",17]]],["يَئِسْنَ","have despaired","ya-is'na","",[["يَئِسْ",1013],["نَ",52]]],["مِنَ","of","mina",""],["ٱلْمَحِيضِ","the menstruation","l-maḥīḍi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَحِيضِ",1970]]],["مِن","among","min",""],["نِّسَآئِكُمْ","your women","nisāikum","",[["نِّسَآئِ",210],["كُمْ",4]]],["إِنِ","if","ini",""],["ٱرْتَبْتُمْ","you doubt","ir'tabtum","",[["ٱرْتَبْ",879],["تُمْ",4]]],["فَعِدَّتُهُنَّ","then their waiting period","faʿiddatuhunna","",[["فَ",7],["عِدَّتُ",778],["هُنَّ",52]]],["ثَلَـٰثَةُ","(is) three","thalāthatu",""],["أَشْهُرٍۢ","months","ashhurin",""],["وَٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى","and the ones who","wa-allāī","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى",17]]],["لَمْ","not","lam",""],["يَحِضْنَ","[they] menstruated","yaḥiḍ'na","ۚ",[["يَحِضْ",4689],["نَ",52]]],["وَأُو۟لَـٰتُ","And those who (are)","wa-ulātu","",[["وَ",1],["أُو۟لَـٰتُ",87]]],["ٱلْأَحْمَالِ","pregnant","l-aḥmāli","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَحْمَالِ",2861]]],["أَجَلُهُنَّ","their term","ajaluhunna","",[["أَجَلُ",234],["هُنَّ",52]]],["أَن","until","an",""],["يَضَعْنَ","they deliver","yaḍaʿna","",[["يَضَعْ",499],["نَ",52]]],["حَمْلَهُنَّ","their burdens","ḥamlahunna","ۚ",[["حَمْلَ",1060],["هُنَّ",52]]],["وَمَن","And whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["يَتَّقِ","fears","yattaqi",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["يَجْعَل","He will make","yajʿal",""],["لَّهُۥ","for him","lahu","",[["لَّ",8],["هُۥ",5]]],["مِنْ","of","min",""],["أَمْرِهِۦ","his affair","amrihi","",[["أَمْرِ",82],["هِۦ",5]]],["يُسْرًۭا","ease","yus'ran",""]]},{"t":"That is the command of Allāh, which He has sent down to you; and whoever fears Allāh - He will remove for him his misdeeds and make great for him his reward.","w":[["ذَٰلِكَ","That","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["أَمْرُ","(is the) Command","amru",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["أَنزَلَهُۥٓ","which He has sent down","anzalahu","",[["أَنزَلَ",77],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["إِلَيْكُمْ","to you","ilaykum","ۚ",[["إِلَيْ",26],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَمَن","and whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["يَتَّقِ","fears","yattaqi",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["يُكَفِّرْ","He will remove","yukaffir",""],["عَنْهُ","from him","ʿanhu","",[["عَنْ",34],["هُ",5]]],["سَيِّـَٔاتِهِۦ","his evil deeds","sayyiātihi","",[["سَيِّـَٔاتِ",211],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَيُعْظِمْ","and make great","wayuʿ'ẓim","",[["وَ",1],["يُعْظِمْ",4782]]],["لَهُۥٓ","for him","lahu","",[["لَ",8],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["أَجْرًا","(his) reward","ajran",""]]},{"t":"Lodge them [in a section] of where you dwell out of your means and do not harm them in order to oppress them. And if they should be pregnant, then spend on them until they give birth. And if they breastfeed for you, then give them their payment and confer among yourselves in the acceptable way; but if you are in discord, then there may breastfeed for him [i.e., the father] another woman.","w":[["أَسْكِنُوهُنَّ","Lodge them","askinūhunna","",[["أَسْكِنُ",1265],["و",4],["هُنَّ",52]]],["مِنْ","from","min",""],["حَيْثُ","where","ḥaythu",""],["سَكَنتُم","you dwell","sakantum","",[["سَكَن",620],["تُم",4]]],["مِّن","(out) of","min",""],["وُجْدِكُمْ","your means","wuj'dikum","",[["وُجْدِ",4643],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَلَا","and (do) not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["تُضَآرُّوهُنَّ","harm them","tuḍārrūhunna","",[["تُضَآرُّ",2091],["و",4],["هُنَّ",52]]],["لِتُضَيِّقُوا۟","to distress","lituḍayyiqū","",[["لِ",8],["تُضَيِّقُ",3282],["وا۟",4]]],["عَلَيْهِنَّ","[on] them","ʿalayhinna","ۚ",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِنَّ",52]]],["وَإِن","And if","wa-in","",[["وَ",1],["إ